          "guid": "mt4h9ifxmjxhg35y",
          "message": {
            "text": "Blink does not feed raw naturalWidth/naturalHeight directly into concrete object-fit geometry under CSS zoom. At the pinned Chromium revision, LayoutImage::UpdateNaturalSizeIfNeeded passes EffectiveZoom to GetNaturalDimensions; the live discriminator painted an intrinsic 80×40 image at zoom 1.25 as 100×50. This split keeps the source SVG coordinate system unzoomed while the renderer applies the captured multiplier exactly once; old serialized trees deliberately default to 1.",
            "markdown": "Blink does not feed raw naturalWidth/naturalHeight directly into concrete object-fit geometry under CSS zoom. At the pinned Chromium revision, LayoutImage::UpdateNaturalSizeIfNeeded passes EffectiveZoom to GetNaturalDimensions; the live discriminator painted an intrinsic 80×40 image at zoom 1.25 as 100×50. This split keeps the source SVG coordinate system unzoomed while the renderer applies the captured multiplier exactly once; old serialized trees deliberately default to 1."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/capture/types.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 1842,
                  "endLine": 1851,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  /** Unzoomed intrinsic pixel dimensions of <img>. */\n  imageIntrinsic?: { w: number; h: number };\n  /**\n   * Blink `LayoutImage::UpdateNaturalSizeIfNeeded()` passes the element's\n   * effective zoom into `ImageResource::GetNaturalDimensions()`. The renderer\n   * multiplies `imageIntrinsic` by this value only for concrete object-fit\n   * geometry; the source SVG coordinate system remains unzoomed. Older\n   * serialized trees default to 1.\n   */\n  imageEffectiveZoom?: number;"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
